  {
    "field": "dictionary_constant.doc",
    "value": "Bundled record of the three Choquet capacity axioms: monotonicity, sequential continuity from below along increasing unions, and sequential continuity from above along decreasing intersections of closed sets. The third axiom distinguishes a capacity from a general outer measure."
  },
